   342	# Who reviews is NOT the server's decision any more (task #10). It used to hand-pick a
   343	# single Claude seat here, which quietly made "one reviewer" the real policy no matter
   344	# what the gauntlet config said. The panel now comes from the config, and the family
   345	# floor decides whether it's enough.
